            <div id="pageheader_0_documentdescription_0_DivCode">
    <div class="text--lead">
    <p>The Work Injury Compensation Act (WICA) lets employees make claims for work-related injuries or diseases, without having to take legal action. Use <a href="/eservices/services/work-injury-compensation">management of your work injury compensation</a>&nbsp;to submit WIC documents online. Find out what is covered and how to file or dispute a claim and check a claim status.</p>
